{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真大量です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボンソワール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま、ジャパン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスはすごく良い所でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログとモバメができなかったね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´;ω;｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初コメントを見ていてみんなも私と同じことを思ってくれていたから どうにかできないかなぁ...って思って実はパリ出発前に 5日間のモバメを送っちゃいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一気に大量に送ったからびっくりさせちゃってたらごめんねm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(隣の席はさゆにゃんじゃなくて、まいまいとみおなでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥にもちゃんと買ったし、らりんにも買ったし、グミも買ったよ♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑メール見てくれてる人にはわかるよね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からまたいつも通り送れるので よろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリではたくさんの貴重な経験をさせて頂いて本当に感謝です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃめちゃ楽しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は中学の頃、世界史の授業ではフランス革命に一番興味があっていつか絶対にフランスに行ってみたいと思ってたの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街並みは映画を観ているよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこを見ていても飽きないし 歩いてる方もオシャレな方ばかり、ちなみにお散歩してるワンちゃんはヨークシャテリアをよく見かけました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヴェルサイユ宮殿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンコルド広場"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ヴェルサイユに行くときに通った)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凱旋門"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンゼリゼ通り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルーヴル美術館(車の中から)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノートルダム大聖堂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オペラ座ガルニエ宮"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん見たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番ゆっくり観れたヴェルサイユ宮殿はもうずっと鳥肌が立っていて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教科書で見るのとは全然違いますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうどマキシワンピースを着ていたから、この長い階段をドレスを着た気分で優雅に降りてみたり。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏はマカロンさえあれば一人でも平気で住める、なんて言ってましたよ〜みなさん（　･`ω･´)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯もおいしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/07/07/3239836/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペリエ！※お酒ではありません笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスの飲み物はほとんどが常温"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹を冷やさないため、らしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常温の炭酸水...斬新だったけど確かに たくさん飲んでもお腹は痛くならなかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして 本題のジャパンエキスポ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスで乃木坂46を知ってる方はいるのだろうか、その中でライブを観に来てくれる方はどれくらいいるのだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての海外でのライブということで不安は大きくて、言葉の通じない場所でどうやって気持ちを伝えるかを考えていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに立つその瞬間までは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際にステージに立つと まずフランスのみなさんは私達を受け入れてくださって拍手で迎えてくださいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの名前も叫んでくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミサミサ！は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスヮァミスヮァ！に聞こえた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスヮァミスヮァ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに答えるように 横を見れば今までに見たことが無いようなメンバーの表情(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉が伝わらない分\"どうにかしてこの気持ちを伝えたい\"と16人の心が一つになったように私には見えました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん反省点もたくさんありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の経験を この新しいパワーを日本でも出せれるように、一番近くで言うと8月に始まる全国ツアーで出していきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていつか、今度は全員で海外でライブできるようなグループになりたいと強く思いました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそういえば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本とフランスの違い？というかあることを発見したんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンの時、フランスのみなさんは真剣な眼差しで観ていたなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の曲に比べて 集中して聞いているイメージ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おぉ...こうゆうかっこいい系の曲もやるんだ...‼︎!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と見入ってくれていたのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん...っと、どういうノリで聞けばいいんだこの曲..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思っていたのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽曲そのものに聴き入ってくださっていたのか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふと疑問に思いました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回パリに行ったことは自分の中で何かの大きなきっかけになるような気がしてならない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからフランス語を勉強して、もうちょっとコミュニケーション取れるようになってから また必ず行きたいと思いました(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも 家に帰ってすぐにモチモチの白ご飯を食べて 今日はラーメンを食べて、なんだかんだやっぱり一番好きなのは日本なんだな〜と改めて思いホッとしました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ振り返れば思い出がたくさん溢れ出てくるところなんです、が！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リリース日の9日まで後少し♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も歌収録をしてきたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"